   "source": "brief",
   "text": "2. The injection budget as a first-class object. If volume is the causal lever, the budget is a decision variable, not a hyperparameter. Can an agent decide *how much* retrieved experience to admit per step, and does a learned or calibrated budget dominate a fixed one?"
